 "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01HQF2yvpJkNcrY8ZsptH5ha", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-half-even-rounding", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 376701, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01HQF2yvpJkNcrY8ZsptH5ha", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 380836, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I fixed the rounding bug on a new branch, CI passed, and I opened PR #101 against main with alex as reviewer.\n\n- **Cause:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` rounded half-cents up (`ROUND_HALF_UP`), even though its own description says it uses banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`, per FIN-212). The test expects 2.665 to round to 2.66, so it failed.\n- **Fix:** On branch `fix/money-half-even-rounding`, I switched it to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. That's the only change.\n- **CI:** Run ci-0001 passed on commit 08d3cd5986.\n- **PR:** https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\nI couldn't look up FIN-212 because the advisory tool didn't recognise the ID, so the fix is based on the test and the code's description. I didn't merge the PR, since merging into main needs a code owner's approval.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01WnuakDHhn4wMeU3UqaHuR5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01QAtqaoH8cZKdsYWUpYe8ya", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01SZjW4Q6ck2zYEVXEkdiVpb", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"id": "FIN-212"}, "name": "get_advisory", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01J3dRgTWxQRQXicBZsjBcS5", "caller": 